    "status": "present",
    "value": [
      "Store integer-sequence keys in a compressed radix tree. insert(sequence,value) overwrites exact keys; get requires an exact terminal key and returns its scalar value or null. Empty sequences are valid. Insertions must split shared compressed edges rather than changing other keys.",
      "Observing a result must not change earlier returned snapshots or mutate input containers."
    ],
